Third-party data: ReSpecTh Kinetics Data

The files under tests/fixtures/respecth/ (ignition-delay, laminar-burning-velocity,
jet-stirred-reactor, outlet-concentration, concentration-profile and burner-flame records;
the directory's README lists each) are unmodified member files of the
ReSpecTh Kinetics Data (RKD) archives published on the Open Science Framework
mirror of the ReSpecTh database (https://osf.io/nbmzv/,
DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/NBMZV), (c) RESPECTH, licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Carmel does not redistribute the
database itself; carmel/data/respecth_manifest.json pins the archives it reads
by OSF file id, version and sha256, and they are downloaded at run time.

Users of these data are asked by the ReSpecTh maintainers to cite, for the
hydrogen records:

  Olm, C.; Zsely, I. Gy.; Palvolgyi, R.; Varga, T.; Nagy, T.; Curran, H. J.;
  Turanyi, T. Comparison of the Performance of Several Recent Hydrogen
  Combustion Mechanisms. Combustion and Flame 2014, 161 (9), 2219-2234.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2014.03.006

  Varga, T.; Nagy, T.; Olm, C.; Zsely, I. Gy.; Palvolgyi, R.; Valko, E.;
  Vincze, G.; Cserhati, M.; Curran, H. J.; Turanyi, T. Optimization of a
  Hydrogen Combustion Mechanism Using Both Direct and Indirect Measurements.
  Proceedings of the Combustion Institute 2015, 35 (1), 589-596.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2014.06.071

for the syngas records:

  Olm, C.; Zsely, I. Gy.; Varga, T.; Curran, H. J.; Turanyi, T. Comparison of
